From 283bf10af711b17ce0453f4d01fe869c7f2aaf53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Axel Tobieson <axel.tobieson@spiideo.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 13:55:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: fill prediction/residual/unfiltered planes + CTB
 bits + POC getter
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- transform.cc: capture prediction (8-bit, before add_residual) and
  residual (reconstructed−prediction, +128 bias stored as u8) in the
  scale_coefficients_internal TU path. 10-bit left unfilled.
  Residual plane initialized to 128 (bias offset) so zero-coefficient
  TUs decode as i16=0 after un-biasing.
- decctx.cc: full-frame memcpy to unfiltered planes immediately before
  run_postprocessing_filters (deblock + SAO).
- slice.cc: CABAC byte-delta × 8 stored in ctb_bits[] around each CTU
  decode (~8-bit granularity).
- image.h/image.cc: add pixels_unfiltered[3], pixels_confwin_unfiltered[3],
  ctb_bits uint32_t array; expand alloc_internals_planes signature;
  release_internals_planes frees new allocations.
- de265_internals.h/cc: DE265_INTERNALS_DECODER_PARAM_SAVE_UNFILTERED
  enum value; get_image_plane handles UNFILTERED case;
  de265_internals_get_CTB_bits(), de265_internals_get_image_poc().
- decctx.h: param_internals_save_unfiltered flag.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
